il pressure from the Upper Mohawks led the Lower tribes to grant the Mohawks a share of the proceeds from the sale of Plaster beds.\'  The prior use of foreign currency in external trade cannot be ruled out.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2830, 'temperature': 0.2})
